<title>GREECE: SCHUBERT TO BE THE NEW HEAD AT BANKAMERICA-SOURCE.</title>
<headline>SCHUBERT TO BE THE NEW HEAD AT BANKAMERICA-SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Werner Schubert, currently country manager at Bank of America, Spain, will succeed Leo Metaxas as head of Bank of America, Athens, in mid-August, a market source told Reuters.</p>
<p>Metaxas has announced his decision to resign his post and join another financial institution. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
